{"id":"book-iii-translator-and-historical-edition-notes-part-7","label":"Book III — Translator and historical edition notes (part 7)","headingNoteRefs":"","context":"Book III","kind":"commentary","blocks":[{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-930]: Σφόδρα τοῦ πρὸς τί καὶ ἕνεκα τίνος εὑρισκομένου τοῖς τούτων ἐπιμελομένοις, περὶ τὰς ὁρμὰς, καὶ τὰς φαντασίας, καὶ φύσεις τῶν ζώων, καὶ τὰς κατασκευὰς τῶν σωμάτων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-930"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-931]: χρεοκοπεῖται .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-931"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-932]: ἐν εὐτελεῖ καὶ εὐκαταφρονήτῳ λέξει .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-932"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-933]: καθημαξευμέναι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-933"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-934]: 1 Cor. ii. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-934"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-935]: τῆς στοιχειώσεως .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-935"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-936]: ἐντυπωθήσεται .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-936"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-937]: χρόνοις αἰωνίοις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-937"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-938]: ὡς ἐν ἐπιδρομῇ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-938"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-939]: τὰ ἅγια ἀναγνώσματα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-939"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-940]: πῶς δεῖ ἐφοδεύειν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-940"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-941]: οἱ ἰδιῶται τῶν ἐκ τῆς περιτομῆς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-941"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-942]: αἰσθητῶς 