-principles-vi-v-957"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-958]: 1 Cor. ii. 12, 13, and 16 ad fin.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-958"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-959]: Μυρίων ὅσων κἀκεῖ, ὡς δἰ ὀπῆς, μεγίστων καὶ πλείστων νοημάτων οὐ βραχεῖαν ἀφορμὴν παρεχόντων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-959"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-960]: ἀπόῤῥητα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-960"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-961]: παντελῆ μυστήρια .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-961"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-962]: Luke xi. 52 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-962"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-963]: The Septuagint: Καὶ σὺ δὲ ἀπόγραψαι αὐτὰ σεαυτῷ τρισσῶς, εἰς βσυλὴν καὶ γνῶσιν ἐπὶ τὸ πλάτος τῆς καρδίας σου · διδάκω οὖν σε ἀληθῆ λόγον, καὶ γνῶσιν ἀληθῆ ὑπακούειν, τοῦ ἀποκρίνεσθαί σε λόγους ἀληθείας τοῖς προβαλλομένοις σοι . The Vulgate reads: Ecce, descripsi eam tibi tripliciter, in cogitationibus et scientia, ut ostenderem tibi firmitatem et eloquia veritatis, respondere ex his illis, qui miserunt te.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-963"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-964]: Cf. note 4, ut supra .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-964"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-965]: 1 Cor. ii. 6, 7 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-965"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-966]: παρανόμῳ νυμφίῳ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-966"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-967]: τῶν κάτω νοημάτων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-967"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-968]: πεπολιωμένοις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-968"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-969]: Cf. 1 Cor. ix. 9 and Deut. xxv. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-969"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-970]: Cf. 1 Cor. ix. 9, 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-970"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-971]: Cf. 1 Cor. ii. 6, 7, 8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-971"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-972]: 1 Cor. x. 11 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-972"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-973]: 1 Cor. x. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-973"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-974]: Cf. Ex. xxv. 40 and Heb. viii. 5 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-974"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-975]: ἀλληγορούμενα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-975"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-976]: Col. ii. 16 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-976"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-977]: Heb. viii. 5 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-977"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-978]: ὡς θεῖον ἄνδρα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-978"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-979]: Rom. xi. 4; cf. 1 Kings xix. 18 . [3 Kings according to the Septuagint and Vulgate enumeration. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-979"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-980]: τινὰς ἀπὸ τοῦ θεῖου γένους , i.e., Israelites.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-980"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-981]: περὶ τῶν αἰσθητῶν δημιουργημάτων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-981"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-982]: γλαφυρόν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-982"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-983]: αὐτόθεν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-983"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-984]: ὑπὸ τῆς λέξεως ἑλκόμενοι τὸ ἀγωγὸν ἄκρατον ἐχούσης .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-984"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-985]: ἐν τῇ διηγήσει τῆς περὶ τῶν νοητῶν ἀκολουθίας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-985"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-986]: κατὰ τὸ σῶμα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-986"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-987]: Οὐδὲ τούτων πάντη ἄκρατον τὴν ἱστορίαν τῶν προσυφασμένων κατὰ τὸ σωματικὸν ἐχόντων, μὴ γεγενημένων · οὐδὲ τὴν νομοθεσίαν καὶ τὰς ἐντολὰς πάντως τὸ εὔλογον ἐμφαίνοντα . One ms . reads γεγενημένην , referring to ἱστορίαν , on which one editor remarks, “Hic et in sequentibus imploro fidem codicum!”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-987"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-988]: διὰ δοκούσης ιστορίας καὶ οὐ σωματικῶς γεγενημένης .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-988"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-989]: κατὰ την λέξιν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-989"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-990]: ὅσον ἐπὶ τῷ καθ᾽ ἑαυτοὺς τηρεῖσθαι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-990"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-991]: Gen. xvii. 14 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-991"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-992]: Ex. xvi. 29 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-992"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-993]: ψυχρὰς παραδόσεις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-993"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-994]: τόπον ἑκάστῳ εἶναι δισχιλίους πήχεις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-994"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-995]: Εἰς ἀπεραντολογίαν ἐληλύθασι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-995"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-996]: Luke x. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-996"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-997]: εἰ μὴ ἄρα πεπονθώς τι παρὰ φύσιν τυγχάνοι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-997"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-998]: 1 Cor. vii. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-998"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-999]: εἰκῆ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-999"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1000]: καὶ τῇ κατὰ τὸ ῥητὸν χρησίμων νομοθεσίᾳ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1000"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1001]: γέγονεν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1001"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1002]: κατὰ τὸ αἰσθητόν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1002"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1003]: Cf. Gen. xlviii. 22 and Josh. xxiv. 32 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1003"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1004]: Cf. Ex. xx. 12 and Eph. vi. 2, 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1004"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1005]: χωρις πάσης ἀναγωγῆς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1005"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1006]: Cf. Ex. xx. 13–16 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1006"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1007]: [ Matt. v. 22 .]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1007"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1008]: Matt. v. 34 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1008"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1009]: 1 Thess. v. 14 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1009"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1010]: Εἰ και παρὰ τοῖς φιλοτιμοτέροις δύναται σώζειν ἕκαστον αὐτῶν, μετὰ τοῦ μὴ ἀθετεῖσθαι τὴν κατὰ τὸ ῥητὸν ἑντολην, βάθη Θεοῦ σοφίας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1010"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1011]: περιελκυσθήσεται .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1011"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1012]: John v. 39 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1012"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1013]: ὁπροηγούμενος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1013"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1014]: ῞Ολον τὸν νοῦν φιλοτιμητέον καταλαμβάνειν, συνείροντα τὸν περὶ τῶν κατὰ τὴν λέξιν ἀδυνάτων λόγον νοητῶς τοῖς οὐ μόνον οὐκ ἀδυνάτοις, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἀληθέσι κατὰ τὴν ἱστορίαν, συναλληγορουμένοις τοῖς ὅσον ἐπὶ τῇ λέξει, μὴ γεγενημένοις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1014"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1015]: ἐν ᾽Ιησοῦ τῷ τοῦ Ναυῆ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1015"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1016]: 1 Cor. x. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1016"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1017]: Rom. ix. 6, 8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1017"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1018]: Rom. ii. 28, 29 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1018"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1019]: Πᾶσα γὰρ ἀρχὴ πατριῶν τῶν ὡς πρὸς τὸν τῶν ὅλων Θεὸν, κατωτέρω ἀπὸ τοῦ Χριστοῦ ἤρξατο τοῦ μετὰ τὸν τῶν ὅλων Θεὸν καὶ πατέρα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1019"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1020]: Matt. xv. 24 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1020"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1021]: Rom. ix. 8 . [See Dr. Burton’s Inquiry into the Heresies of the Apostolic Age (Bampton Lectures), pp. 184, 185, 498, 499. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1021"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1022]: Gal. iv. 26 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1022"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1023]: Heb. xii. 22, 23 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1023"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1024]: ἐν ψυχῶν γένει .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1024"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1025]: τοῦ καλουμένου χωρίου ᾅδου .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1025"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1026]: καὶ παρὰ τοισδε, ἤ τοῖσδε τοῖς πατράσι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1026"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1027]: Matt. xiii. 44 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1027"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1028]: Cf. Isa. xlv. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1028"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1029]: Rom. ix. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1029"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1030]: Cf. Gen. xxxii. 28–30 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1030"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1031]: Heb. viii. 5 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1031"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1032]: Extrinsecus.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1032"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1033]: Hostes inimicosque.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1033"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1034]: Ne illud quidem sacramento aliquo vacuum puto.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1034"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1035]: Quem primum omnium Israelitici belli dextra defenderat.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1035"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1036]: Rigare et inundare animas sitientes, et sensus adjacentes sibi.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1036"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1037]: Formam.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1037"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1038]: Lam. iv. 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1038"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1039]: Cf. Rev. xiv. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1039"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1040]: Omnis gloria regis intrinsecus est. Heb., Sept., and Vulgate all read, “daughter of the king.” Probably the omission of “filiæ” in the text may be due to an error of the copyists. [Cf. Ps. xlv. 13 .]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1040"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1041]: Rom. xi. 33 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1041"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1042]: Rom. xi. 33 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1042"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1043]: [ Eccles. vii. 23, 24 .] The Septuagint reads: Εἶπα, Σοφισθήσομαι · καὶ αὕτη ἐμακρύνθη ἀπ᾽ ἐμοῦ, μακρὰν ὑπέρ ὃ ἦν, καὶ βαθὺ βάθος, τίς εὑρήσει αὐτό ; the Vulgate translates this literally.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1043"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1044]: Cf. Isa. xli. 22, 23 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1044"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1045]: Isa. vi. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1045"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1046]: Cf. Ecclus. xvi. 21 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1046"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1047]: Ex nullis substantibus.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1047"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1048]: 1 John i. 5 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1048"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1049]: Cf. Heb. i. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1049"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1050]: Cf. Heb. i. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1050"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1051]: Quæ quidem quamvis intellectu multa esse dicantur.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1051"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1052]: Quæ sunt extra Trinitatem.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1052"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1053]: Cf. 2 Cor. xiii. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1053"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1054]: Gal. ii. 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1054"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1055]: Quam in aliis sanctis viris. “Aliis” is found in the mss. , but is wanting in many editions.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1055"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1056]: Cf. Matt. xxii. 30 and Luke xx. 36 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1056"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1057]: Unde constat in singulis quibusque tantum effici Christum, quantum ratio indulserit meritorum.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1057"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1058]: Cf. Col. i. 16–18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1058"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1059]: John i. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1059"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1060]: Ps. xxxiii. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1060"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-1061]: Cf. John i. 26, 27 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-1061"},{"text":"